<Layout
	title="Terms & Conditions — Kalpataru Exhibition"
	description="The terms that apply when you use the Kalpataru Exhibition website and services."
>
	<PageHero
		eyebrow="Legal"
		lines={['Terms &', 'Conditions']}
		subtitle="The terms that apply when you use this website and our services."
		compact
	/>

	<section class="section legal tone-white">
		<div class="container">
			<article class="prose" data-reveal>
				<p>
					<!-- DUMMY — real effective date to be added -->
					Last updated: August 2026
				</p>
				<p>
					<!-- DUMMY intro -->
					These terms ("Terms") govern your use of this website and the services of Kalpataru
					Exhibition ("we", "us"). By using this website you agree to these Terms.
				</p>

				<h2>1. Our services</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY — align with the real scope of work -->
				<p>
					Kalpataru Exhibition provides exhibition stall design, fabrication and turnkey
					installation services. Descriptions and imagery on this website illustrate the type
					of work we do and do not constitute a binding offer.
				</p>

				<h2>2. Quotes and orders</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					All quotations are estimates and remain valid only for the period stated on the
					quotation. A project is confirmed only when both parties sign a written agreement or
					acknowledge an accepted order.
				</p>

				<h2>3. Payment</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					Payment schedules are defined in each project agreement. Late payments may delay
					production and delivery.
				</p>

				<h2>4. Client responsibilities</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					Clients are responsible for providing accurate briefs, approved artwork and any
					permissions required from show organisers in a timely manner. Delays in approvals may
					affect delivery dates.
				</p>

				<h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					Designs, drawings and concepts we create remain our property until full payment is
					received, after which agreed rights transfer to the client. We may photograph
					completed projects and show them in our portfolio unless agreed otherwise in writing.
				</p>

				<h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY — have real legal text drafted before launch -->
				<p>
					To the fullest extent permitted by law, Kalpataru Exhibition is not liable for
					indirect or consequential losses. Our total liability in connection with any project
					is limited to the amount paid by the client for that project.
				</p>

				<h2>7. Cancellations</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					Cancellation terms are set out in each project agreement and depend on the stage of
					the project at the time of cancellation.
				</p>

				<h2>8. Website use</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					Content on this website is provided for general information only. You may not copy,
					reproduce or redistribute our content without written permission.
				</p>

				<h2>9. Changes</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					We may update these Terms from time to time. The current version will always be
					available on this page.
				</p>

				<h2>10. Contact</h2>
				<!-- DUMMY -->
				<p>
					Questions about these Terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or
					call {SITE.phone}.
				</p>
